7:["$","$L15",null,{"eyebrow":"Our story","headLine1":"Born in Accra.","headLine2":"Dressed for Everywhere.","p1":"Miss Tokyo started with a simple idea: every woman in Ghana deserves to feel cute, confident, and stylish — without spending a fortune to get there.","p2":"We curate pieces that are bold, playful, and unmistakably feminine. Statement streetwear, delicate accessories, dreamy sleepwear, everyday must-haves. All carefully selected. All affordable.","p3":"From a small pop-up on Dome Road to a full online store serving customers across Ghana — this is Miss Tokyo.","stat1Value":"240+","stat1Label":"Styles in store","stat2Value":"2K+","stat2Label":"Happy customers","stat3Value":"4.9★","stat3Label":"Average rating","storyHeading":"The Miss Tokyo Story","storyP1":"We believe getting dressed should feel exciting, not stressful. That you should not have to choose between looking good and staying within budget. That fashion should be accessible — and fun — for every woman in Ghana and beyond.","storyP2":"Miss Tokyo was founded on this belief. We source every piece with care, test quality personally, and only stock what we would actually wear ourselves.","quoteText":"We don't just sell clothes. We sell the feeling of walking into a room and owning it.","quoteAuthor":"Miss Tokyo Team","timeline":[{"body":"A small table, a rack of clothes, and a dream. Our first weekend market pop-up on Dome Road sold out in a day.","year":"2021","title":"It started with a pop-up"},{"body":"We launched online, reached customers in Kumasi, Tema and Takoradi for the first time. Orders came in while we slept.","year":"2022","title":"First online store"},{"body":"Crossed our first major milestone. Expanded the catalogue to include accessories, footwear, and activewear.","year":"2023","title":"1,000 customers"},{"body":"A fully redesigned online store, same-day delivery in Accra, and a team growing as fast as our community.","year":"2025","title":"New chapter"}],"values":[{"body":"We believe great style should not come with a luxury price tag.","icon":"heart","title":"Affordable by Design"},{"body":"Every item that reaches you has been personally checked.","icon":"shield","title":"Quality First"},{"body":"Miss Tokyo was built by the women of Ghana, for the women of Ghana.","icon":"users","title":"Community Always"},{"body":"We stock pieces that work for work, play, dates, weekends and everything in between.","icon":"globe","title":"Made for Real Life"},{"body":"We say what we mean. Our sizing is real, our reviews are real.","icon":"message","title":"Honest Conversations"},{"body":"New drops, new categories, better service, wider delivery. Miss Tokyo is always evolving.","icon":"trending-up","title":"Always Growing"}],"team":[{"bio":"The vision behind Miss Tokyo.","name":"Akosua T.","role":"Founder & Creative Director","avatar_color":"#C4896A"},{"bio":"Keeps the wheels turning and customers happy.","name":"Esi M.","role":"Head of Operations","avatar_color":"#8B5CF6"},{"bio":"Has an eye for what is going to sell before it hits the market.","name":"Abena K.","role":"Buyer & Stylist","avatar_color":"#059669"},{"bio":"The friendly voice behind every message and email.","name":"Maame A.","role":"Customer Experience","avatar_color":"#E8485A"}],"ctaEyebrow":"Ready to shop?","ctaHeadline":"Start Your Miss Tokyo Journey","ctaBody":"Browse over 240 styles — new drops every week. Free delivery in Accra on orders over GH₵150.","ctaBtnLabel":"Shop Now","ctaBtnUrl":"/shop"}]
